V-1
Admin panel:

1.	Login, logout, and profile
2.	User CRUD
3.	Role CRUD
4.	Assignments [Running, Done, All] details with status
5.	Admin Can upload completed work files, links, and so on…

User Panel:

1.	Login, Logout, Register
2.	After login (Profile, Assignment[All list, Received, Not Received, Complete]) details with status
3.	Assignment category (Project, Assignment)
4.	Logged-in users can upload pdf, any image format [ios-HEIF or HEVC], file drive links, and others.
5.	After uploading the completed file or resource from the admin, the user can view his/her assigned work-ready file/resource.

Database:

0.   Base (id, created_at, created_by, updated_at, updated_by)

1.	User
-	Admin panel:  (first_name, last_name, email, password, is_enable, is_verified)
-	User panel: (first_name, last_name, email, password)
2.	Role (name, description)
3.	Users_Role (user_id, role_id)
4.	Contact (user_id, phone, WhatsApp, Telegram, Facebook, LinkedIn,  town, zip, Country)

5.	Assignment (user_id, title, additional_note)
6.	Assignment_Category (assignment_id, name, details)
7.	Amount (assignment_id, amount, discount, bonus)
8.	Status (assignment_id, current_stage, stage_details/remarks for assignor) [Get, Receiver, Running, Complete, Delivered]
9.	Timeline (assignment_id, assigned_date, accepted_date, deadline_by_assignor, extended_deadline_by_assignor, remaining_day_hour)

●	Need Categories for Assignments and projects, maybe subject name or code too.
●	Messages to show to the user when lands on landing page
●



